Applying the curve-type notation for a four-layer model, we evaluate the two possible three-layer groupings. The first grouping (1-2-3) and the second grouping (2-3-4) both follow the $r_1 < r_2 < r_3$ pattern, resulting in an AA curve type. This interpretation is consistent with the AA-type classification currently recorded on file for this station.

