Applying the VES notation rules, every group of three consecutive layers follows the $r_1 < r_2 < r_3$ pattern (A). Therefore, the calculated curve type is A. Please note that the current on-file classification of H-type is incorrect, as the layer values indicate a continuous increase rather than the decrease-then-increase pattern characteristic of an H-type curve.

